Denis,

The function 'powerTrans' is actually internal to RRPP.

Do you have the latest versions of both RRPP and geomorph installed?  I just tried the function using the latest versions of both and it worked without error.

Please do a fresh install from github for both and try again:

Pak::pkg_install(.....)

